### Tone

- Spanish-first copy (the menu is in Spanish). English subtitles in small text under each dish.
- Warm, personal voice. Avoid "place your order" / "checkout" — prefer "**Hacer pedido por WhatsApp**" / "Order via WhatsApp".
- Use the 🇻🇪 flag emoji sparingly (header + WhatsApp message only).

### Visual feel

- Rounded corners everywhere (`rounded-2xl` on cards, `rounded-full` on buttons).
- Soft shadows (`shadow-sm` / `shadow-md`, never harsh).
- Generous whitespace, large tap targets (≥ 44px).
- No bold gradients other than the watercolor in the logo.

