## 10. Stock photos

Abi Norma doesn't have professional photos yet, so use **placeholder stock photos** the grandchild can swap later. Two acceptable approaches — **pick one and be consistent**:

### Option A (preferred): curated Unsplash photos committed to `/public/images/`

Download Venezuelan / Latin food photos from Unsplash (free for commercial use, attribution appreciated). Save as the filenames referenced in `menu.json`. Suggested search terms per dish:

| Dish family            | Unsplash search term |
|------------------------|----------------------|
| Arepas (any color)     | `arepas venezuelan`, `arepa` |
| Caraotas negras        | `black beans bowl` |
| Lentejas               | `lentil stew`, `cooked lentils` |
| Arroz blanco/amarillo  | `white rice plate`, `yellow rice` |
| Pollo mechado          | `shredded chicken` |
| Pollo guisado          | `chicken stew potatoes` |
| Pollo fajitas          | `chicken fajitas pan` |
| Albóndigas             | `meatballs in sauce` |
| Pavo / hamburguesitas  | `turkey burger`, `ground turkey skillet` |
| Pisillo de pescado     | `shredded fish`, `tilapia flaked` |
| Carne mechada          | `shredded beef`, `ropa vieja` |
| Asado negro            | `venezuelan asado negro`, `pot roast dark sauce` |
| Bistek / salteado      | `steak peppers onions skillet` |
| Salsa Bologna          | `bolognese sauce pan` |

Save each as a **square crop at ~800×800px** to keep the grid tidy.

### Option B (faster, swap later): use a lightweight placeholder service

Render `<img src={`https://images.weserv.nl/?url=source.unsplash.com/featured/?${searchTerm}&w=600&h=600&fit=cover`}>` — but note this is a runtime dependency on a third-party. **Only do this if Option A is too tedious**, and add a clear TODO in the README to replace with self-hosted images before launch.

**In either case**, every `<img>` tag must include:
- `alt={item.name}` for accessibility,
- `loading="lazy"` to keep the page fast,
- A graceful fallback (`onError` → a light-blue tinted placeholder div with the dish emoji).

